-        represents the 9:16 region that will be exported from the current
+        represents the selected vertical region that will be exported from the current
         project frame: full visible height, centred horizontally, with the
         width derived from the 9:16 ratio. Geometry is computed from the
         already letterboxed viewport, so it adapts to resizing, zoom and DPI.
@@ -556,7 +561,7 @@ class VideoWidget(QWidget, updates.UpdateInterface):
